 R←Test_Misc_010(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;qdmx
⍝ Regression test: `Assert` must honour an error number passed as ⍵'s second item.
⍝ It used to signal 11 whatever was passed.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :Trap (~stopFlag)/11 22                            ⍝ Assert signals one or the other
     'my msg'##.GitHub.Assert 0
     →T.PassesIf 0                    ⍝ Must not get here: Assert has to signal
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.PassesIf 11=qdmx.EN
     →T.PassesIf'my msg'≡qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap

 :Trap (~stopFlag)/11 22                            ⍝ Assert signals one or the other
     'my msg'##.GitHub.Assert 0 22
     →T.PassesIf 0                    ⍝ Must not get here either
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     →T.PassesIf 22=qdmx.EN           ⍝ 22, not 11
     →T.PassesIf'my msg'≡qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap

 →T.PassesIf 1≡'my msg'##.GitHub.Assert 1

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
